      "writtenOn": "2023-04-13T18:52:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The mechanism is here:\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/kernel/superproject/+/common-android-mainline:build/kernel/kleaf/workspace_status_stamp.py\n\nThe process is going to be transformed a lot after https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/q/hashtag:%22kleaf-stamp-repo%22+(status:open%20OR%20status:merged), but the general idea is still:\n\n- Bazel calls `scripts/setlocalversion common/` (see workspaace_status_stamp.py) and store the result somewhere\n- Bazel unsets `CONFIG_LOCALVERSION_AUTO` and set `LOCALVERSION\u003d` empty\n- When entering Kbuild, Bazel restores the result to $OUT_DIR/localversion, so when Kbuild executes `setlocalversion` it just `cat $OUT_DIR/localversion`",
      "parentUuid": "0b905cc3_611572c6",
      "revId": "0d2ae0b1c54ffd1473a1a86394355cf48f88cef8",
